{"entities":"[{\"text\": \"peripheral neuropathy\", \"id\": \"D010523\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}, {\"text\": \"ethambutol\", \"id\": \"D004977\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"Ethambutol\", \"id\": \"D004977\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"optic neuropathy\", \"id\": \"D009901\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}, {\"text\": \"polyneuropathy\", \"id\": \"D011115\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}, {\"text\": \"visual loss\", \"id\": \"D014786\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}, {\"text\": \"paresthesias\", \"id\": \"D010292\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}, {\"text\": \"ethambutol\", \"id\": \"D004977\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"ethambutol\", \"id\": \"D004977\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"toxicity\", \"id\": \"D064420\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}]","filtered_entities":[{"text":"peripheral neuropathy","id":"D010523","label":"Disease"},{"text":"ethambutol","id":"D004977","label":"Chemical"},{"text":"optic neuropathy","id":"D009901","label":"Disease"},{"text":"polyneuropathy","id":"D011115","label":"Disease"},{"text":"visual loss","id":"D014786","label":"Disease"},{"text":"paresthesias","id":"D010292","label":"Disease"},{"text":"toxicity","id":"D064420","label":"Disease"}],"head":"ethambutol","head_id":"D004977","pairs":[{"head":"ethambutol","tail":"peripheral neuropathy","head_id":"D004977","tail_id":"D010523"},{"head":"ethambutol","tail":"optic neuropathy","head_id":"D004977","tail_id":"D009901"},{"head":"ethambutol","tail":"polyneuropathy","head_id":"D004977","tail_id":"D011115"},{"head":"ethambutol","tail":"visual loss","head_id":"D004977","tail_id":"D014786"},{"head":"ethambutol","tail":"paresthesias","head_id":"D004977","tail_id":"D010292"},{"head":"ethambutol","tail":"toxicity","head_id":"D004977","tail_id":"D064420"}],"relations":["D004977 | D010523","D004977 | D009901","D004977 | D011115","D004977 | D014786","D004977 | D010292","D004977 | D064420"],"result":"$","tail":"toxicity","tail_id":"D064420","text":"Optochiasmatic and peripheral neuropathy due to ethambutol overtreatment. Ethambutol is known to cause optic neuropathy and, more rarely, axonal polyneuropathy. We characterize the clinical, neurophysiological, and neuroimaging findings in a 72-year-old man who developed visual loss and paresthesias after 11 weeks of exposure to a supratherapeutic dose of ethambutol. This case demonstrates the selective vulnerability of the anterior visual pathways and peripheral nerves to ethambutol toxicity.","metrics":{"precision":0.6666666666666666,"recall":1.0,"f1":0.8,"rel_tp":4,"rel_fp":2,"rel_fn":0}}